notes: >
  Companion papers (XL, LIII-LIX; eight in all), derivation documents,
  verification scripts (thirteen scored suites totalling 244 checks, plus
  two witness scripts), and referee reports for the book
  "The Crystal and the Clock". Preprints, not peer-reviewed; the
  machine-referee reports in reviews/ are part of the record.
